ez la bonne r\u00e9ponse.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "MFL", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 10, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "frn4le01ob08re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Imaginez que vous travaillez pour un magazine. Vous devez \u00e9crire un guide touristique pour votre village ou ville.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Compl\u00e9tez les \u00e9tapes suivantes. Remplissez la grille d'auto-\u00e9valuation. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn4le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Vous aimez la bonne nourriture, visiter de beaux endroits et faire les magasins ? En plus d'\u00eatre magnifique, Paris est l'une des villes les plus fascinantes d'Europe. Cette ville est c\u00e9l\u00e8bre pour ses caf\u00e9s, son architecture, ses mus\u00e9es, sa musique et sa mode.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn4le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Les sites touristiques</span><br>\nDans le centre-ville, il y a de nombreux monuments historiques tels que la tour Eiffel, la cath\u00e9drale Notre-Dame de Paris et le mus\u00e9e du Louvre. Berceau de la haute couture, Paris est aussi la capitale de la mode. Passer l'apr\u00e8s-midi \u00e0 d\u00e9ambuler dans les rues de Paris. Fl\u00e2ner dans les magasins des Champs-\u00c9lys\u00e9es. Sortir des sentiers battus et s'impr\u00e9gner du mode de vie parisien. Aller de part et d'autre de la Seine, fleuve qui traverse Paris. Chiner au march\u00e9 aux puces de Saint-Ouen. Tant de choses \u00e0 faire !", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "frn4le01ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">La nourriture</span><br>\nLa France est r\u00e9put\u00e9e pour sa gastronomie. Rien de tel qu'un bon repas fran\u00e7ais dans l'un des nombreux restaurants que compte la ville. Vous pouvez \u00e9galement vous asseoir \u00e0 la terrasse d'un caf\u00e9. Les parisiens aiment prendre le temps de d\u00e9guster leur caf\u00e9. C'est l'un des meilleurs moyens de d\u00e9couvrir Paris.", "id": 3, "time": "51000", "image": "frn4le01ob08re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">H\u00e9bergement et transport</span></br>\nIl y a des centaines d'h\u00f4tels implant\u00e9s partout dans la ville. Ils sont g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement proches des lieux touristiques.\nLa ville est aussi bien desservie par les transports en commun.\n<br><br>\nVoulez-vous visiter Paris ?", "id": 4, "time": "71000", "image": "frn4le01ob08re2img04.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le01ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul><li>Qu'est-ce qu'un guide touristique ?</li></ul>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img02.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 2, "time": "2500", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul><li>Que devrait inclure un guide touristique ?</li></ul>", "id": 3, "time": "22000", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img04.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 4, "time": "35500", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img05.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 5, "time": "44500", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img06.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 6, "time": "51500", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img07.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 7, "time": "61000", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img08.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 8, "time": "69500", "image": "frn4le01ob08re3img09.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le01ob08re3aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le01ob08re3img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}